        "title": "Differentiate the geometric series",
        "text": "The derivative of $$\\frac{1}{1-x}$$ is $$\\frac{1}{\\left(1-x\\right)^2}$$, which equals the sum of $$n x^{n-1}$$ for $$n \\geq 1$$. Multiplying by $$x$$, the sum of $$n x^n$$ is $$\\frac{x}{\\left(1-x\\right)^2}$$.",
